In 2008, Dean Nicolle, Malcolm French and Nathan McQuoid described two subspecies of E. conferruminata and the names have been accepted by the Australian Plant Census:
 Eucalyptus conferruminata D.J.Carr & S.G.M.Carr subsp. conferruminata that has an operculum more than {{cvt|12|mm}} wide at the base;
 Eucalyptus conferruminata subsp. recherche D.Nicolle & M.E.French that has an operculum less than {{cvt|12|mm}} wide at the base.
